{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172470/extras/D_TheBackwars.png?t=1740459924\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Backwars</strong> is a survival horror game that keeps you on edge at all times. Whether you\u2019re playing alone or with friends, your only goal is to survive. Scavenge for food and water, build what you need to stay alive, and hide from the unspeakable horrors hunting you. Each level is packed with threats that force you to think fast and act faster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172470/extras/D_AWorldofFear.png?t=1740459924\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into an unforgiving world where everything feels disturbingly real. The heavy atmosphere, eerie sounds, and gritty visuals pull you into a nightmare that won\u2019t let go. Every item, object, or system in the game connects in ways that can surprise or terrify you. Nothing feels safe, and nowhere is truly secure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172470/extras/D_SurviveAgainstAllOdds.png?t=1740459924\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The entities stalking you aren\u2019t the only danger\u2014other players can be just as deadly. Trust can get you killed, and alliances rarely last long. Whether you\u2019re hiding in the dark, crafting tools, or fighting for your life, every moment is a gamble.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172470/extras/D_PlayYourWa.png?t=1740459924\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Backwars</strong> offers different ways to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face the horrors solo for the ultimate test of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up in co-op mode to improve your chances\u2014but beware of betrayal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go head-to-head in versus mode, where the only thing scarier than the monsters is each other.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172470/extras/D_KeyFeatures.png?t=1740459924\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Haunting Atmosphere</strong>: Realistic graphics and chilling sound design keep the tension high.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survival at Any Cost</strong>: Manage food, water, and resources to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Complex Interactions</strong>: Everything in the game can affect something else\u2014use this to your advantage or suffer the consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Gameplay</strong>: The combination of players, creatures, and interactive systems ensures no two experiences are the same.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Backwars</strong> doesn\u2019t just challenge your skills\u2014it tests your nerve. Will you survive the rooms? Or will the horrors break you first?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3172470?t=1740459924","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172470/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740459924","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172470/ebdb1f5913895a2f29fed67c582bc69c34a161df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740459924","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172470/ebdb1f5913895a2f29fed67c582bc69c34a161df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740459924","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-o